Importing the data from the Washtenaw County endorsements spreadsheet... is WEIRD!

Steps to complete the import.

1. Export google sheet as ODS, say washtenaw.ods

2. Open in OpenOffice.  Save as "Western Europe US ASCII",
   say washtenaw.tsv.  Use tab for field separators, nothing 
   for text delimiter.

3. Clean-up.  Translate carriage-return chars, 
   eliminate completely blank lines.

      tr <washtenaw.tsv "\r" "\n" | grep -v "^$" >temp1

4. Fix special characters and newlines in text
      php phase81fixWashtenaw.php <temp1 >temp2

5. Fix the header row (in temp2)
      "Candidate's full name..."    => "name"
      "Candidate Email Address"     => "email"
      "Candidate website URL"       => "web"
      "Phone"                       => "phone"
      "statement"                   => "description"

6. Import
      php phase82importWashtenaw.php temp2
